pseudo-Boolean proof version 3.0
% Regression test: normalizing `1 x1 1 ~x1 >= i64::MIN` cancels the two terms and lowers
% the degree by one, which used to wrap to 9223372036854775807 and stored the trivially
% true input constraint as the empty contradiction. The formula is satisfiable.
f 1 ;
output NONE;
conclusion UNSAT : 1 ;
